OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity facing 'worst crisis
OL,4,Asince WW2' as staff begin five-week
OL,5,Astrike
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe University of Dundee is facing the
OL,8,Fworst financial crisis of any British
OL,9,Fhigher education institution since
OL,10,FWorld War Two, its principal has said
OL,11,Fas lecturers begin an unprecedented
OL,12,Ffive-week strike.
OL,14,FProf Nigel Seaton, interim principal
OL,15,Fand vice-chancellor, made the claim as
OL,16,Fstaff take industrial action over the
OL,17,Fthreat of compulsory redundancies.
OL,19,FMembers of the UCU union will not take
OL,20,Fpart in lectures, seminars or tutorials
OL,21,Funtil after 23 October.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
